#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:4
msgid "Container Registry Integration"
msgstr "Container Registry Integration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides container registry integration within Kubernetes "
"clusters through the ``KubernetesRegistryService``. This allows Kubernetes "
"workloads to pull images from private container registries configured in "
"|morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| proporciona container registry integration dentro de Kubernetes "
"clusters a través de el ``KubernetesRegistryService``. Este permite "
"Kubernetes cargas de trabajo a pull imágenes desde privado container "
"registries configurado en |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:11
msgid ""
"Container registries are managed as Docker Registry integrations and can be "
"associated with Kubernetes clusters to enable authenticated image pulls."
msgstr ""
"Contenedor registries son administrado como Docker Registry integrations y "
"puede be asociado con Kubernetes clusters a habilitar authenticated imagen "
"pulls."

