"|morpheus| injects the appropriate image pull secret into the pod "
"specification"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| injects el appropriate imagen pull secret en el pod specification"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:66
msgid ""
"The container image reference in the Instance Type configuration determines "
"which registry is used"
msgstr ""
"El container imagen reference en el Instancia Tipo configuración determines "
"cual registry es utilizado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:67
msgid "Registry credentials are resolved automatically based on the image URL"
msgstr ""
"Registry credentials son resolved automáticamente basado en el imagen URL"

