"When removing workloads, |morpheus| automatically cleans up associated "
"service entries from both the Kubernetes cluster and the |morpheus| "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"Cuando removing cargas de trabajo, |morpheus| automáticamente cleans up "
"associated servicio entradas desde ambos el Kubernetes cluster y el "
"|morpheus| registry."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:91
msgid "Working with Private Images"
msgstr "Working con Privado Imágenes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:93
msgid "To deploy workloads using images from a private registry:"
msgstr "A deploy cargas de trabajo usando imágenes desde un privado registry:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:95
msgid "Ensure the registry is added as an integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Asegurar el registry es agregado como un integration en |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:96
msgid ""
"When creating Instance Types or Kubernetes workloads that reference private "
"images, |morpheus| automatically:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando creating Instancia Tipos o Kubernetes cargas de trabajo ese reference"
" privado imágenes, |morpheus| automáticamente:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:98
msgid "Creates the required ``imagePullSecret`` in the target namespace"
msgstr ""
"Crea el requerido ``imagePullSecret`` en el destino espacio de nombres"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:99
msgid "Configures the pod spec to reference the secret"
msgstr "Configura el pod spec a reference el secret"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:100
msgid "Handles credential rotation when registry passwords change"
msgstr "Handles credential rotation cuando registry passwords cambiar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:102
msgid ""
"For Helm charts or raw Kubernetes specs, ensure your manifests reference the"
" image pull secret name that |morpheus| creates, or configure the "
"``imagePullSecrets`` field in your pod spec/service account"
msgstr ""
"Para Helm charts o raw Kubernetes specs, asegurar su manifests reference el "
"imagen pull secret nombre ese |morpheus| crea, o configure el "
"``imagePullSecrets`` campo en su pod spec/servicio account"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:105
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr "Best Practices"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Use dedicated service accounts:** Create service accounts with pre-"
"configured image pull secrets rather than adding secrets to individual pods"
msgstr ""
"**Use dedicated servicio accounts:** Crear servicio accounts con pre-"
"configurado imagen pull secrets rather than adding secrets a individual pods"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Scope registries to namespaces:** Limit registry access to specific "
"namespaces where the images are needed"
msgstr ""
"**Scope registries to espacios de nombres:** Limit registry acceso a "
"específico espacios de nombres donde el imágenes son necesario"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Rotate credentials regularly:** When registry credentials are updated in "
"|morpheus|, the corresponding Kubernetes secrets are updated on next sync"
msgstr ""
"**Rotate credentials regularly:** Cuando registry credentials son "
"actualizado en |morpheus|, el corresponding Kubernetes secrets son "
"actualizado en siguiente sync"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Use registry mirrors:** For air-gapped environments, configure a local "
"registry mirror and add it as the integration endpoint"
msgstr ""
"**Use registry mirrors:** Para air-gapped entornos, configure un local "
"registry mirror y agregar it como el integration endpoint"
